    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "bb6d091a-bfb9-4a8b-b476-457a7846eaa2",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* hotels throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4 dinners \u0026amp; 1 lunch included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll entrance fees included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFull programme of included excursions \u0026amp; guided tours\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional local guide\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Athens\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in Greece\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "8ccf0fb8-808d-4dd4-ac77-b03fd212c854",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFirst two and last two nights at the 4* Hotel Stanley in central Athens, one night at the 4* Amalia Hotel Delphi at the foot of mount Parnassus, one night at the 4* Amalia Hotel Olympia and one night at the 4* Amalia Hotel Nafplio at the entrance to the seaport town that was the capital of modern Greece during the early 1800s. Days 2, 6 and 7 in Athens are on bed and breakfast basis, while the other four nights are on half board basis. All rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "4685d06f-865b-4949-a6ff-605877c7ba73",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAthens - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe Acropolis \u0026amp; the Parthenon\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDelphi - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDelphi Archaeological Museum\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOlympia \u0026amp; Archaeological Museum\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMycenae\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETheatre of Epidaurus\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECruise of the Saronic Gulf\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ENational Archaeological Museum - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "18671b23-22a2-4a41-9527-a4ef00458b13",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ERemember that this tour is just our suggestion to provide inspiration and whet your appetite. Every one of our tours is tailor made exclusively for your group and your group alone. So if you like the look of this tour but want to alter it to suit your group, that\u2019s fine. Tell us how you want to change it and we\u2019ll send you a proposal that meets the exact requirements for your group tour. Then, combining our experience with your understanding of the profile and interests of your members, together we can fine tune the itinerary so that you get the perfect tour at the right price for your group.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "8f075267-1203-468e-a8f1-eb50e1e11ba5",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Athens\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight to Athens from your preferred airport \u2013 transfer with our professional guide in our private executive coach to the 4* Hotel Stanley in central Athens for a two night stay \u2013 dinner in our hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Guided tour of Athens, the Acropolis \u0026amp; the Parthenon\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanoramic guided tour of Athens \u2013 see the Panathenaic Stadium, the Temple of Olympian Zeus and Hadrian\u0026#39;s Arch \u2013 on the Acropolis view the Propylaea, the Temple of Athena Nike, the Erechtheion and, of course, the Parthenon.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Guided tour of Delphi \u0026amp; Delphi Archaeological Museum\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDelphi is renowned as the dwelling place of Apollo \u2013 walking along the Sacred Way, a guided tour takes in the Athenian Treasury, the Amphitheatre, the Sanctuary of Athena and the Temple of Apollo which has stood on the site since the 6th century BC \u2013 the Delphi Archaeological Museum contains a collection second only to those of the Athenian Acropolis and a priceless collection of ancient works of art including the Sphinx of the Naxians, the Silver Bull, the Column of the Dancers and the bronze Charioteer dating back to the 5th century BC \u2013 check in to the 4* Amalia Hotel Delphi for a one night stay \u2013 dinner in our hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Olympia \u0026amp; Archaeological Museum of Olympia\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETravel to the ruins of ancient Olympia where the Olympic Games were originally held every four years to honour Zeus, the father of the Gods \u2013 the Archaeological Museum of Olympia\u2019s collection of finds date from prehistoric times to the early Christian period and include the sculpture collection, for which the museum is most famous, the bronze collection, the richest collection of its type in the world, and the large terracottas collection \u2013 check in to the 4* Amalia Hotel Olympia for a one night stay \u2013 dinner in our hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Mycenae \u0026amp; Theatre of Epidaurus\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETravel to the military stronghold of Mycenae, the Homeric city of the Atreides and the city \u2018rich in gold\u2019 of the ancient poets, to see sights such as the 3,300 year old Lion\u0026#39;s Gate, the Cyclopean Walls and the Royal Tombs \u2013 rediscovered in the 19th century, the wonderfully preserved Theatre of Epidaurus was built in the 4th century BC by Polykleitos and supposedly if you drop a pin in the centre of the orchestra you can hear it from anywhere in the theatre \u2013 travel on to the coastal city Nafplio located in the Peloponnese and check in to the 4* Amalia Hotel Nafplio for a one night stay \u2013 dinner in our hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 6 \u2013 Cruise of the Saronic Gulf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA relaxing day with lunch included cruising the Saronic Gulf and its islands \u2013 at Hydra, a refuge for artists and intellectuals, stroll along the narrow cobblestone streets and admire the wonderful architecture including the 17th century cathedral with its superbly carved wooden screen and icons \u2013 Poros is the greenest of all the Saronic Gulf islands with pine woods and lemon and olive tree groves stretching down to sandy beaches \u2013 at Aegina taste the pistachio for which the island is famous and join the optional visit to the Athena Aphaia Temple, built in 480 BC and 25 of whose original 32 Doric columns still stand \u2013 travel on to Athens and check in again to the 4* Hotel Stanley for a two night stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 7 \u2013 The National Archaeological Museum\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of The National Archaeological Museum, the world\u2019s most important museum dedicated to the history of ancient Greece boasting 11,000 exhibits from 7000 BC to the Roman conquest \u2013 the afternoon is at leisure \u2013 optional farewell dinner.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 8 \u2013 Home\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETransfer to Athens Airport for our scheduled flight back home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
